  "description": "*“Do you like me?”*\n\nIn eighth grade, Hwi-Min gets caught with a photo of his crush, Jung-Won, and ends up receiving unwanted attention. Whether it was luck or misfortune, the commotion quickly died down thanks to his already-existing status as a total outcast. Time passed indifferently, with no entanglement between the popular, cool Jung-Won and the nerdy, awkward Hwi-Min. After enough time passed for what once felt like a life-or-death situation to become a nostalgic black history, the now-adult Hwi-Min lives a peaceful, ordinary life as an unknown band member juggling multiple part-time jobs...\n\nUntil one day, he finds Jung-Won in an alley... or rather, he ends up picking him up?\n\n *“Can I stay at your place?”\n\n“I'll pay you back with my body in exchange for a place to sleep.^^”*\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
